+// Airoha FlowSense RPC backend (ucode plugin for rpcd-mod-ucode).
+//
+// Ported from Gilly r7. Run as an rpcd exec plugin: one ucode process per
+// query replaces shell pipelines while isolating kernel-blocked Wi-Fi reads
+// from the rpcd event loop. A native in-process plugin is unsafe on this driver.
+// backend.sh is kept alongside as a manual fallback/debug tool; nothing calls it.
+
+'use strict';
